      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and dedicated veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Almost every review in the past six months highlights the friendliness and professionalism of the Stanningley team. Owners who have recently switched from other practices comment that the difference in care is immediately noticeable. Receptionists, nurses, and vets are all praised, and several reviewers name individual team members for their kindness and competence."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling of anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple owners specifically chose White Cross Vets after struggling elsewhere with nervous or reactive animals. Dogs described as difficult, reactive, or previously distressed at other practices are managed calmly and confidently here. Long-term pet owners appreciate the gentle patience shown to cats and dogs during examinations and treatments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough explanations and clear advice"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently note that consultations are unhurried and that every clinical option is clearly explained. Owners of pets with chronic conditions or those facing difficult decisions describe feeling fully informed and supported throughout. Clients emphasize that vets listen carefully to concerns without rushing or pushing unnecessary treatments."
      }
    }
  ],
